        "Naa Yesayyaa Neekai Brathikedanu",
        "Chinthalanni Kaliginanuu",
        "Nindalanni Nannu Chuttinaa",
        "Santhoshamuga Nenu",
        "Naa Yesayyaa Ninne Vembadinthunu"
      ]
